@startuml
actor Client

participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "Eureka Server" as EUREKA
participant "Config Server" as CONFIG
participant "Account Controller" as CTRL
participant "Account Service (RxJava)" as SVC
participant "Account Repository (Reactive MongoDB)" as REPO
database "MongoDB (account-db)" as DB

== REQUEST FLOW ==

Client -> APIGW: POST /api/accounts (JSON)

APIGW -> EUREKA: Discover ACCOUNT-SERVICE
EUREKA --> APIGW: Instance (host:port)

APIGW -> CONFIG: Fetch configuration (account-service.yml)
CONFIG --> APIGW: Properties (port, db, logs)

APIGW -> CTRL: Forward HTTP request

CTRL -> SVC: createAccount(account)

== REACTIVE FLOW (RxJava) ==

SVC -> REPO: save(account)
REPO -> DB: insert document
DB --> REPO: saved document

REPO --> SVC: Single<Account>
SVC --> CTRL: Single<Account>

CTRL --> APIGW: HTTP 201 CREATED + JSON
APIGW --> Client: Response

== OPTIONAL READ FLOW ==

Client -> APIGW: GET /api/accounts/{id}
APIGW -> EUREKA: Resolve ACCOUNT-SERVICE
EUREKA --> APIGW: Instance

APIGW -> CTRL: forward request
CTRL -> SVC: findById(id)
SVC -> REPO: findById(id)
REPO --> SVC: Maybe<Account>

SVC --> CTRL: Maybe<Account>
CTRL --> APIGW: HTTP 200 OK
APIGW --> Client: JSON response

@enduml